Package: hitplotr
Title: Plots season long summary of offensive baseball performance
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Elston", "Miller", email =  "elstonmiller@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates, summarizes, and visualizes offensive baseball performance in youth/recreational leagues where infrastructure may not exist. It can handle wither long-format game-by-game data or season totals. 
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr, tidyr, flexdashboard
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
LazyData: true
